      {
        "id": "0b130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000035",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "I will tell the school in writing straight away if the dose, the timing or anything else on this form changes, or if the medicine is stopped. I will collect any medicine that is left over or out of date. I can withdraw my consent at any time by telling the school in writing.",
        "alignment": "left"
